OL,3,GNEWSAIndependent maternity inquiry
OL,4,Avital, campaigners say
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndependent scrutiny of a hospital
OL,7,Ftrust's maternity services is vital, a
OL,8,Fcampaign group has said.
OL,10,FIn an open letter, Families Failed by
OL,11,FOUH (Oxford University Hospitals)
OL,12,FMaternity Services has called on the
OL,13,Fgovernment to urgently commission a
OL,14,F"full, independent investigation" into
OL,15,Fthe trust's maternity and neonatal
OL,16,Fservices.
OL,18,FThe group, made up of more than 800
OL,19,Ffamilies, was launched in June 2024 in
OL,20,Fresponse to growing concerns over the
OL,21,Fsafety and quality of OUH's maternity
OL,22,Fcare.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
