OL,3,GNEWSAIndependent maternity inquiry
OL,4,Avital, campaigners say
OL,5,
OL,6,FOUH said it remained "fully committed
OL,7,Fto... continuously improve the quality
OL,8,Fof maternity care". The Department of
OL,9,FHealth and Social Care (DHSC) said the
OL,10,Fhealth secretary would be meeting the
OL,11,Fgroup in the near future.
